  message: "Fixed via member_expression handling in _extract_object_properties(). The Hapi config-object extractor already accepted 'this' as a receiver; only the handler value extraction was missing. this.route({method:'get', path:'/', handler: this.getAllStrategies}) now produces UsageContext with handler_name='getAllStrategies'."  # 905e
